    # Heliosphere Structure Reference:
    #   - Termination Shock (inner): ~80 AU (solar wind slows to subsonic)
    #   - Termination Shock (outer): ~100 AU (R_b boundary)
    #   - Heliopause: ~122 AU (Voyager 1: Aug 2012, Voyager 2: Nov 2018)
    #   - Outer Oort Cloud: ~100,000 AU
    #
    # Role in Ug2 (Outer Field Bubble):
    #   U_g2 = k_2 × [(ρ_vac,[UA] + ρ_vac,[SCm]) × M_s / r²] × S(r - R_b)
    #          × (1 + δ_sw × v_sw) × H_SCm × E_react
    #
    # Step Function S(r - R_b):
    #   S = 1 if r ≥ R_b (OUTSIDE bubble → Ug2 active)
    #   S = 0 if r < R_b (INSIDE bubble → Ug2 = 0)
    #
    # Physical Interpretation:
    #   - R_b defines transition from internal (Ug1) to external (Ug2) gravity
    #   - Inside R_b: Ug1 (Internal Dipole) dominates
    #   - Outside R_b: Ug2 (Outer Field Bubble) active
    #   - Corresponds to heliosphere/stellar wind bubble boundary
